# Audit Trail UI — Task Plan & Implementation Log

## Plan
- High-level goal: Build a responsive, reactive Audit Trail UI for System Administrators and IQA Staff that queries and visualizes the immutable `audit_logs` table with filterable table, search bar, status badges, metrics, and an interactive detail inspection drawer.
- Scope:
  - In:
    - Backend: `AuditLogController` with role authorization (`system_admin`, `iqa_staff`/`iqa_member`), college scoping, search/filtering, pagination, and KPI metrics.
    - Route: `/admin/audit -logs` registered in `routes/web.php`.
    - Frontend: Modular Vue 3 components under `resources/js/Pages/Admin/AuditLogs/`:
      - `Index.vue` (shell & integration)
      - `Partials/AuditMetricsStrip.vue` (summary KPIs)
      - `Partials/AuditFilterBar.vue` (search, category, college, severity filters)
      - `Partials/AuditLogsTable.vue` (core table with DaisyUI components, sorting, pagination)
      - `Partials/AuditDetailDrawer.vue` (slide-over drawer with payload details, cryptographic hash, before/after diffs)
  - Out:
    - Mutation/delete APIs (forbidden; logs are strictly immutable and append-only).
- Key decisions:
  - Use DaisyUI `table`, `card`, `badge`, `modal`, `btn`, `input`, `select` per design system guidelines.
  - Keep all Vue components under 150–200 lines by modularizing into partials.
  - Multi-tenancy enforcement via `MultiTenantScopeService`: System Admin and IQA have university-wide view; college deans are scoped to their `college_id`.
  - Inertia router requests with `preserveState` and `preserveScroll` for snappy reactivity.
- Edge cases to handle:
  - Null actor (`user_id` is null, e.g. unauthenticated domain rejection or system background jobs).
  - Empty search results state with quick reset action.
  - Null or malformed `details` JSON payloads.
  - Truncated text with full value displayed in detail drawer.
- Testing strategy:
  - Feature tests covering route authorization (system_admin vs iqa_staff vs unauthorized roles like task_force).
  - Feature tests for search query filtering, college scoping, and pagination.
  - Frontend build verification via `npm run build`.

